Let $A$ represent Art and $M$ represent Music. Find the union, then subtract it from the group total.

$\begin{aligned}|A\cup M|&=|A|+|M|-|A\cap M|\\&=31+26-11\\&=46\end{aligned}$

$\begin{aligned}|(A\cup M)'|&=|\xi|-|A\cup M|\\&=60-46\\&=14\end{aligned}$

$14$ students study neither.

